function searchVariants(value){const base=normalize(value),variants=new Set([base]);for(const [from,to]of [['신칸센','신칸선'],['신칸선','신칸센'],['구마가와','쿠마가와'],['쿠마가와 철도','쿠마가와테츠도우']])if(base.includes(from))variants.add(base.replaceAll(from,to));return[...variants]}
function routeGroup(route){if(route.category==='custom')return'custom';if(countryId==='jp'&&route.dataKind==='trainService')return'limited-express';if(route.category==='shinkansen')return'shinkansen';return route.category}
